{% comment %}
  Quiz Funnel — Steps 12-13 (Closing Questions)
  Step 12: Caffeine / Stimulant Dependence
  Step 13: Commitment Level
{% endcomment %}

<!-- ══ STEP 12: CAFFEINE DEPENDENCE ══ -->
<div class="qf-step" data-step="12">
  <button class="qf-back" onclick="qfGoBack(12)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg></button>
  <h2 class="qf-q">Do you rely on caffeine, energy drinks, or stimulants just to feel functional?</h2>
  <p class="qf-sub">This tells us how hard your body is working just to stay baseline — and what critical minerals it's been missing to do it naturally.</p>
  <div class="qf-opts">
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="No" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,12)"><div class="qf-opt__label">No — my energy is stable without it</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Sometimes" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,12)"><div class="qf-opt__label">Sometimes — mainly after a bad night's sleep</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Yes" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,12)"><div class="qf-opt__label">Yes — I need it just to feel like a normal human being</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Multiple/day" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,12)"><div class="qf-opt__label">Multiple times a day — without it I completely crash</div></button>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ══ STEP 13: COMMITMENT ══ -->
<div class="qf-step" data-step="13">
  <button class="qf-back" onclick="qfGoBack(13)"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg></button>
  <h2 class="qf-q">If you knew there was a proven way to reverse what's happening to your body — would you actually commit to it?</h2>
  <p class="qf-sub">Not another pill. Not another gadget. A simple, daily protocol backed by clinical research that takes less than 30 seconds.</p>
  <div class="qf-opts">
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Yes" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,13)"><div class="qf-opt__label">Yes — I'm done waiting. I'm ready to fix this.</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Probably" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,13)"><div class="qf-opt__label">Probably — if the evidence is real, I'm in.</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Maybe" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,13)"><div class="qf-opt__label">Maybe — I'd need to see exactly how it works first.</div></button>
    <button type="button" class="qf-opt" data-answer="Not sure" onclick="qfPickOpt(this,13)"><div class="qf-opt__label">Not sure yet — but I want to see my results.</div></button>
  </div>
</div>
